                <pb facs="0261" n="155" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg155"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Hicks to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <hi rendition="#italic"><date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1906-08-18">August 18,
                        1906</date></hi>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Night sixteenth frightful earthquake, destroying many buildings with loss of
                    life. Lighter shocks continued until to-day. Thousands persons slept two nights
                    in parks. Plazas and houses deserted. Legation safe.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hicks.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
